leep\">Shiversleep</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Broken%20Dream\">Broken Dreams</a> on <a href=\"#/wiki/Half-Buried%20Face\">Half-Buried Faces</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFollows its target around but does not harm them.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tLeave them alone. If you kill them, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dream%20Butterfly\">Dream Butterfly</a> will curse you (very minor damage) when you next speak to it.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 91 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dreamhaunters\">Dreamhaunters</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Guzzlemaw\">Animated Guzzlemaw</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bad%20Dream\">Bad Dream</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Choking%20Fear\">Choking Fear</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Countess%20Sorrow\">Countes